  "description": "Kokoro-82M v1.0 ONNX text-to-speech model for DemaConsulting.Speech, run\n      directly through ONNX Runtime with no bundled native inference engine (unlike\n      DemaConsulting.Speech.Sherpa's sherpa-onnx-backed models). This package owns the full\n      text-to-speech pipeline for this one model family itself - phonemization (via an embedded,\n      verified word-to-phoneme lexicon), tokenization, and ONNX Runtime inference - installed into\n      a SpeechModelCatalog via the AddKokoroModels() extension method. Reference this package\n      alongside DemaConsulting.Speech to get this model out of the box; core DemaConsulting.Speech\n      itself ships with zero built-in models and has no dependency on ONNX Runtime.",
  "iconFile": "Icon.png",
